The voice half of relational memory. Sent to the voice builder 2026-10-24:
- memory used only after identity is verified where required;
- at most one item per call, never in an ask turn;
- stop using memory mid-call on the forget phrases, ideally with a 'forget_request' moment;
- the ask-to-keep shape for a volunteered personal detail.
Plus the joint returning-caller practice scenario (promise recall; zero creepy or unconfirmed references).
